Package: idbiosys
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Linux-Philippines-Found <hoyoverse.edit@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-flask (>= 3.0), python3-pil, gunicorn, xdg-utils
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser
Description: CVAFPI ID-BIO attendance and identification system
 Linux kiosk application for barcode-based attendance, student management,
 CSV imports, audit review, and optional camera snapshots.
